ar expression.\n\nAdded option to exclude otherwise accepted revisions based on their\ncommit message matching some regular expression.", "created_at": "2017-06-29T09:31:08Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ddb87b638f78ee364e2e1ad10995bd20ca1d39f8", "message": "Added example for mapping ticket numbers.", "created_at": "2017-04-03T14:59:20Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bbd4367a8655e218d35b2142ddd5ef1b6061368e", "message": "Added configuration option to map changesets to another ticket.", "created_at": "2017-04-03T14:56:11Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae28ebfd49cb3be62671522de5e2abe6ade06d98", "message": "Allow access to static utilities in Main.", "created_at": "2016-10-04T07:26:49Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "80b0a667f7251098b61e725cdafd1abde99291dd", "message": "Fixed out of bound access when parsing paths from non-regular commits.", "created_at": "2016-10-04T07:26:06Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e32189893cfae79c66939ac3d0876b9868369e2b", "message": "Fixed quoting issues in MappingLoader, added test case.", "created_at": "2016-10-04T07:25:19Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "27fe6391bbea91a2bbacc898147459fd2ec08115", "message": "Moved resource mappings to a separate file.\n\nThe `resourceMapping` property now points to a separate properties-like\nfile containing mappings of the form:\n\n# Comment\nregexp = replacement", "created_at": "2016-10-02T15:40:34Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d778a6a85cb9da41f512b6b4ac400190495e39e9", "message": "Updated launch config.", "created_at": "2016-10-02T10:34:14Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fb6dfa4bc26938324e81f29227720ef5e293ad7d", "message": "Do use HEAD revision for analyzing the target branch.\n\nThe PEG revision is only relevant for the source branch. Since the\ntarget branch is being modified, only the HEAD revision is relevant.", "created_at": "2016-10-02T10:33:35Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "253056f3c05977fd0734db0d7faccc9df35a0798", "message": "Allow escaping ',' using \"\\,\" in mapping specs.", "created_at": "2016-10-02T10:31:37Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2c3507155eab232a1ea874f1b5afe3aeb153f131", "message": "Use target branch modules as module to merge.", "created_at": "2016-05-13T07:52:26Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c2ecff8309623de40d034365ecd6ca4fa0f36c54", "message": "Refactoring: Pulled out merge info test to MergeInfoTester.\n\nAdjusted merge info test case to actually test the productive code - not\nonly a similar version of it.", "created_at": "2016-05-13T07:50:55Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e5baa111aa1ad9e8047d55389682f37fdf2c5d5f", "message": "Enhanced merge info test case.", "created_at": "2016-05-13T07:21:26Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2d9998b06c55986a3c373e905ed45af5e2d3326e", "message": "Handle intra-branch copies from modified sources correctly.\n\nCopy the version without the changes by creating a backup copy before\napplying regular changes. See\nTestMerge.testModifyResourceCopiedFromModifiedSource().", "created_at": "2016-03-30T07:18:14Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5b7b8f0e3f0dfbc023c11f89e2a531a7e77b71b6", "message": "Allow dynamically updating configuration properties during merge.", "created_at": "2016-03-29T08:00:28Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d38804c089833d8a73f0848d39c0036079cf4b4f", "message": "Merge branch 'master' of https://github.com/haumacher/subcherry.git", "created_at": "2015-12-20T17:38:10Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b43ad54e237304d1fd9a09b0098155fac039ce83", "message": "Updated to SVNKit 1.8.10.", "created_at": "2015-12-20T17:37:47Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "48c7e91539a1b0ebad8fa7510bf58ab8b216a668", "message": "Do not order commits according to the order of their \"originals\".\n\nThis breaks, if some commits have originals (are merged) and others have\nnot.", "created_at": "2015-12-20T17:36:08Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ce06f65ea6729518239b68e6b621bec80e1fc42e", "message": "Do not crash on invalid (not well-formatted) commit messages.", "created_at": "2015-12-20T17:33:06Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d8fe015ad5965b174b7b8f815d5d15823c08f178", "message": "Do not directly commit after joining a revision, but ask for command.", "created_at": "2015-12-20T17:27:25Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "92d27f21d0cd90dbbe6cb1641fc16a0fda5f1946", "message": "Enhanced error message for invalid mapping specifications.", "created_at": "2015-12-20T17:26:11Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "958ec4fa4150c0557c7f2a9b6f6ce3a4cb10b074", "message": "Quote '#' characters in URLs.", "created_at": "2015-12-20T17:24:36Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3d5f213fdfb1a0e9ae20adb66c9033ecda3ae59c", "message": "Mark as conflict, if a rewritten path touches a module not being merged.", "created_at": "2015-12-20T17:20:19Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b0f98d1ff7e1ed979d462a58909c65aa04b83069", "message": "Added missing translations for ConflictDescriptor.Reason.", "created_at": "2015-12-20T17:17:53Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4727f2bd0df76aa8f079db3e9991e9c1311488d1", "message": "Reverted sorting resource mappings.\n\nThe keys may be regular expressions. Therefore sorting them makes no\nsense.", "created_at": "2015-09-09T13:11:28Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "318917c0041e14eb3371881bf8777f0da11d49ad", "message": "Bugfix: When joining revisions, the commit messages should be joined\nusing \\n, not \\\\n.", "created_at": "2015-07-08T09:30:55Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8e34c76c36b412fe5c0f1f3ca04f593a8e74eaf4", "message": "Bugfix: Reported merge info from JavaHL may be null. This must be\nwrapped with a guard object to shied using code.", "created_at": "2015-07-03T09:09:32Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "33ea043202c41a5bba318ac256752c4f958941ee", "message": "Bugfix: The resource mapping must be build by sorting the mapped path\nprefixes in descending order. This ensures that a longer path is tried\nto match before a prefix of another path. This allows to define\ndifferent mappings in sub-directories of a path.", "created_at": "2015-07-02T12:12:33Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7632a085c081ea0e5a14a83bc946e72f4079079b", "message": "Copy from the WORKING revision when creating semantic move merges. This\nnot only works around a bug in JavaHL not being able to copy from the\nBASE revision, but also allows compacting multiple revisions to a single\nrevision without interleaving commits.", "created_at": "2015-05-26T15:50:10Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0c8a626d9dda73f7553385f2e25894b6476b7c16", "message": "Added regression test for cyclic rename (renaming foo to bar, bar to\nzzz, and zzz to foo).", "created_at": "2015-05-26T12:51:38Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c8830808139104d1b31fdcec30222e4aef54a8cd", "message": "Force deletes in tests.", "created_at": "2015-05-26T12:49:49Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4e858d887b609af7f20442c02e5a714198aa9b8f", "message": "Allow Revision parameter for copy tests.", "created_at": "2015-05-26T12:49:16Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7a6707ab25a73c5e965c9171df4c76f605a6ec0f", "message": "Use force parameter when merging changes with JavaHL", "created_at": "2015-05-26T12:15:47Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fef16ce8322bb5beab89c2e4d68283436942e6a0", "message": "Use branch prefix for reverted commits.", "created_at": "2015-05-26T12:13:24Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0ceec84221b82c16738875ff1146d8c57afe18b3", "message": "No semantic moves and no reordering during revert.", "created_at": "2015-05-26T09:43:33Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "074add0b0c64ad03b0131d8defb93450edd237cf", "message": "Merge pull request #3 from haumacher/svnkit-abstraction-2\n\nSvnkit Abstraction integrated.", "created_at": "2015-05-13T08:04:32Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "986fe2e0fd279d1d40e68f840377c3c4cc855c78", "message": "Updated configuration template with newer options.", "created_at": "2015-05-13T07:55:20Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a06ad23c4f88d0cafc7d3bf7cea751606bdad5ea", "message": "Fixed file headers, updated settings and code templates.", "created_at": "2015-05-13T07:36:33Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ddb0b1576f1c6697ce4e0e28d10606f32ce7847", "message": "#2: Added pre-commit conflict detection in the JavaHL binding.", "created_at": "2015-05-13T07:12:36Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d910e4afb6f102d469c5e69d981a3384181dfb8a", "message": "Added regression test case for conflict detection.", "created_at": "2015-05-13T06:46:15Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8a606d418b4438f88bcb9bbdc167babf433d609b", "message": "Relaxed assertion on revision numbers. For revision ranges, a revision\nwith number 0 could be useful. Enhanced assertion error message.", "created_at": "2015-05-13T06:45:44Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b370290b85c50b41fb6d22bf9ecfe7035d7cf2cd", "message": "Bugfix: `getMergeInfoLog()` with SVNKit did not report merged revisions.\nThe restriction to a single revision was too restrictive.", "created_at": "2015-05-12T20:26:01Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6d0a3e958120caea1d77894e00b84cbc0af1b45e", "message": "Bugfix: getMergeInfoLog() with SVNKit expected an empty revision range\nand did not report merged revisions.", "created_at": "2015-05-12T20:17:52Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0957facfa16d7b1308b1823081f942d6730e5015", "message": "Follow-up for [2001e9c097857671d7b147a2f7fc60731ee3b98c]: Adjusted test\ncase to the expectation that adds create parent directories instead of\nscheduling tree conflicts.", "created_at": "2015-05-12T20:09:03Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f338e2c07b6404ef4ea054d77d59e2c71dee3524", "message": "Added API to resolve conflicts in the working copy.", "created_at": "2015-05-12T20:07:35Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2d9cfc9a83023584f665e5c8f1d081361b5ac833", "message": "Bugfix: Merge tracking suppressed too much revisions. The\nRevisionRange.getStart() as reported by getMergeInfo() is exclusive (but\nwas interpreted as inclusive).", "created_at": "2015-05-12T16:06:54Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dbe9b026fd63958278b53dee21b6bb8bb3d8bfac", "message": "Added new modules to team project set.", "created_at": "2015-05-12T14:03:51Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ec88a4521b1dc137a1cedd2dda112ac7b5ae5a3e", "message": "Only inspect merge info for modules that are currently merged.", "created_at": "2015-05-12T12:53:52Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "508d464ef8559e2c152f74f990cbda2fdd8fab84", "message": "Added normalization of merged properties files.", "created_at": "2015-05-12T07:00:31Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5d4e56ed7c923a490cc8cafdc6711d6315a0cb89", "message": "In merged properties files, only use unicode escapes for those\ncharacters that are outside the ISO-8859-1 charset.", "created_at": "2015-05-12T06:47:55Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "68aa4193bb390e9718e5ae603b1508bc6a5d0572", "message": "Added properties conflict resolver for javahl binding.", "created_at": "2015-05-08T14:46:04Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3ade926f30d71733b1b4a0bf1dd13286486c9f3d", "message": "Follow-up for [2a1f69d2c5fadfcc7efa1afa306f443e997c39c3]: Wrong method\nname prefix for configuration interface property `ignoreMergeInfo`.", "created_at": "2015-05-08T14:45:32Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2a1f69d2c5fadfcc7efa1afa306f443e997c39c3", "message": "Implemented merge info analysis to avoid merging revisions twice.", "created_at": "2015-05-08T14:23:09Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d9873c699a90c32bf488929d8419194dd7a65335", "message": "Added test utility to convert paths to URLs.", "created_at": "2015-05-08T14:20:01Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c0ef3c5c39b45319b7722ca017c68452697bd716", "message": "Generalized API of diff() method to use Target instead of RepositoryURL\nand pegRevision.", "created_at": "2015-05-08T14:18:24Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9f020b7945699bf62f5ef4bd50c1712ebc84149e", "message": "Assert that only commit revisions are asked for their commit number.", "created_at": "2015-05-08T12:37:08Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b0ccbb3cbeba9875f3626a7105c2ac0ed1c6400f", "message": "Implemented equality for Revision and RevisionRange.", "created_at": "2015-05-08T12:34:35Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bd07a63d1037b7f6a2d932d1d04ca1203af7ae64", "message": "Prevent duplicate `/` characters in SVN URLs.", "created_at": "2015-05-08T12:30:45Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a6c1bfdec2f21433bb01d8e4d0ce48c80d404262", "message": "Follow-up for [eafd36b20bf3fa3079aeaa70af72262f1b3761ec]: Bugfix: Common\nprefix was to short, if the common prefix directory is among the paths\nbut without a tailing slash character.", "created_at": "2015-05-05T10:57:39Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f43ae99be448cb2511e495b44b0b26f50c7b93f9", "message": "Follow-up for [2001e9c097857671d7b147a2f7fc60731ee3b98c]: Bugfix: Since\nan add implicitly creates parent directories, no conflict must be\nscheduled, if a parent of an added resource is not yet present in the\nfile system at the time the add is constructed.", "created_at": "2015-05-05T10:14:52Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6cb54bc70d0b6774c7fa5bd8e35b7822554b38f4", "message": "Follow-up for [2001e9c097857671d7b147a2f7fc60731ee3b98c]: If a path is\nmarked as added, it cannot be decided which sub-paths are also added.\nTherefore, all sub paths of an added path must be treated as existing (a\npath exists, if any of its ancestor paths are added). In consequence, an\nadded path must not also mark its ancestor paths as added. Otherwise,\nwhen any path is added in a commit, all path would be treated as\nexisting.", "created_at": "2015-05-05T10:12:13Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9674ec2a30975cf90761c5e252cce8cc2abd0e90", "message": "Print operations before starting merge.", "created_at": "2015-05-05T07:31:00Z", "repo": "subcherry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sh